1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,763
Back at the start, it is at the same potential it began with.

2
00:00:03,763 --> 00:00:06,653
All the lifts must equal all the drops.

3
00:00:06,653 --> 00:00:12,825
Around any closed loop, the sum of the e m fs equals the sum of the I R drops.

4
00:00:12,825 --> 00:00:17,291
That is Kirchhoff's second law, and it is the conservation of energy.

